# Progress heartbeat for long tool calls.
# While a tools/call runs and its request carries _meta.progressToken, send
# notifications/progress every 15 seconds until the call settles. Clients reset
# their idle wait only on progress. Some HTTP paths in front of an MCP server cut
# a call that is silent for about 30 seconds, so the beat keeps it alive.
# Also bumps the version to 0.2.1-veecode.1: a published tag is immutable, so a
# changed build needs a new version. The metadata keeps 0.2.1 until that tag is
# published.
# Remove when source.json advances past a Backstage release whose
# mcp-actions-backend sends progress notifications itself.
#
